#: scenario7:scenario7_0AB00C9C_7603_4B7D_94F0_422B925F4353
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 478cc0188df355e4f5d3274adfa218d035f86ab42e266c0266ecc22d110b2d36
#. default-sha256: 9b2a207862606e4dde28663f33b561735ae31137f07640aa8a713b5be30e4455
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0AB00C9C_7603_4B7D_94F0_422B925F4353"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫It was the spring of my "
"fourteenth year."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫那是我十四岁时的春天。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_96C5866C_6F64_4692_8371_78D096629E7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e06457f99a3942525e6c2aefd3aa04b8a2eab30442060863632a82649db5942e
#. default-sha256: 68f8395d45a8a4b7f1ccf4b19ccf9feb1fadf97698b951c7f28a97c8e8adfc7c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_96C5866C_6F64_4692_8371_78D096629E7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, for one, preferred it when the sun ⟪k:1⟫wasn’t⟪k:2⟫ out.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Not that sunlight would "
"kill me,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫对我来说，⟪k:1⟫没有阳光更好。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫虽然有阳光也不会晒死——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8FBE7F3A_6B09_46E2_9E5E_F71067DF0D22
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb09d0be406c13a93d0f9ad81b733b0699a2a0a4f90a5279f0e3443a5ab03a99
#. default-sha256: 00d1e82224efe165ce895978a89ceae212feb8357a779c5c2260235fb45b30e0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8FBE7F3A_6B09_46E2_9E5E_F71067DF0D22"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but if it was bright enough, the whole world was so white I could hardly see a thing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但强烈的光会让我的视野变白，⟪k:1⟫甚至看不见前方。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_33EABD98_BC03_4C5B_A81A_10244168B25D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56095ea033926999107db2a3fc4b51582b65b9dccd3e02baa0ab1e6fef139663
#. default-sha256: b5a5945a65d021d3da1206e197d69d7bf4aac53be21a74f51846ae6550b960c3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_33EABD98_BC03_4C5B_A81A_10244168B25D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As I was meandering through the courtyard,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我漫无目的地走在中庭——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_47DE9F2F_B236_42A3_8344_89543D58A343
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb383c69688f8b4249b622611d178fe7fb38f973e67c573c502b2975330c9abc
#. default-sha256: b6d51c428e1bef36fc7ef8f8189b6b8d9cb1319a9980e71ade8fe28977f6d9b5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_47DE9F2F_B236_42A3_8344_89543D58A343"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I spotted someone I had never seen before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫看到了一个陌生人。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7A0FC6F3_CC1D_4374_8C85_9A990957566C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa556244a8924d25eb4076a25d9657713656fc5b78717369d42837a1e5b2af83
#. default-sha256: 59e1a2f24d2b643200d25fe7790d44b95e852cc0d5084d11274b1a5e95b3d882
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7A0FC6F3_CC1D_4374_8C85_9A990957566C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Who are you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……你是谁？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_55F98633_ED37_45A9_8D4F_1F8F68725FB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68856e8ba691ef04a5a21ecc625285c56e4970639f8ab748b83df8c641d2474e
#. default-sha256: f886ed6fb509b8a1e0599e950461027ab0559c750da41cb449ca97dc1df97efb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_55F98633_ED37_45A9_8D4F_1F8F68725FB4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I asked bluntly, and the girl twirled around, smiling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫听到我失礼的问话，⟪k:1⟫那人回过头露出微笑。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5541FDCB_DB15_422E_B325_810ED59E7372
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c96a845101a19f02fa2126ed0a75396c5c2b30f76d6e599c6900ef407c2b3db2
#. default-sha256: 05220e936db9d525178d859bb993db8bf5b7bb1c0633f77c585b56c2fc4556f1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5541FDCB_DB15_422E_B325_810ED59E7372"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My apologies. You just have such a beautiful courtyard here I let myself in for a "
"little walk."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫抱歉，⟪k:2⟫这中庭很漂亮……我就擅自走了进来。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_45288BEE_D663_41C1_AF44_3429D72D3EE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a88f4d6a19c62ad19281a0904a19dc6f604bac78440df17bc0d4e7b5ff19e0b4
#. default-sha256: fe247d8caec24c2f5a9adddf1c6cc496dedc03939fa8df9ca02ca9df89e953cd
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_45288BEE_D663_41C1_AF44_3429D72D3EE7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Long, chestnut hair flowed over round, feminine shoulders.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It swayed slightly in "
"the wind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫长长的栗色头发垂在她女人味十足的圆润肩膀上，⟪k:1⟫在风中轻轻摇曳。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0B2ABE52_A65A_4EF3_A1D8_199842CE8E31
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30d12c4f879c3f671fc2ef5fc0e33e000ed2f1f566572e18f73c98e0be17141b
#. default-sha256: c0f90486cc72383cbeb122b99a8acde390904b52d26393aea7d2c30e43e218c0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0B2ABE52_A65A_4EF3_A1D8_199842CE8E31"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The cloud of melancholy dissipated in the light of her smile."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫连阴天的忧郁都被她的笑容驱散了。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4D4E9084_E870_492E_A998_C5D99E26EDB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e3b4fd3c1ee066ef00da70c2eb522c7e27c099146f8a0c968d70e16235fa839
#. default-sha256: 24a629c102149c935c892b2d9684399090fd8baeaf5cc6b4b070d87b4371312b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4D4E9084_E870_492E_A998_C5D99E26EDB7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You must be Michelle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re just as pretty as I heard."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫你是米歇尔吧？⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫和我听说的一样呢。⟪k:4⟫真是个漂亮的女孩子。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CCB94BB0_F5ED_434C_B5C7_F0C5C7FCCBAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5b11c5b282a319b63d4b0f7f8b5da3e225c3fef513a1ea3e834800733822c6a
#. default-sha256: 38816f82ede50db34b08b7cce9ad7cc233ffab0358cec57739eddad88ec459fe
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CCB94BB0_F5ED_434C_B5C7_F0C5C7FCCBAA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Finally” meet me? What was she talking about?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I stood there, baffled by this "
"strange woman,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我陷入了茫然，⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫当我不知所措地僵在原地时——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0C0861C5_D4B4_453C_8326_7C12D391459E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39bcabce90d16782f3910e49bc3e15cd0646f47a797a13ccb1c5079380876617
#. default-sha256: 1e5ee9d9a316521cc3c0eac17424f910705dda8a96e80334a01cd7f1a8586a90
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0C0861C5_D4B4_453C_8326_7C12D391459E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m thrilled to make your acquaintance, Michelle."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫很高兴认识你，⟪k:2⟫米歇尔。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_395D00B7_3D6A_4726_82D2_4B0208B5AAE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 821eb237557fb66f806bae2410beb4fbd5c424f85dd606b39c7499f149f05f06
#. default-sha256: d32b3b83aa2aae1b2b9d501b6b5994d4ea2d92560ebd0a51da53f88672a17087
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_395D00B7_3D6A_4726_82D2_4B0208B5AAE9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her voice was like someone pouring honey into my ear."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她的低语如蜜糖般流入我的耳中，⟪k:1⟫让我几近融化——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2E190DA1_1B5B_42B8_9724_46FD4AEA5E64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b290804d25eb85095afa39598a6085355f8527ebd053d57dd454b56126198b4
#. default-sha256: 9df31869874322a6ca102d81cca4bcf1f19a801c251ea33280df7b8af5d8592a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2E190DA1_1B5B_42B8_9724_46FD4AEA5E64"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫stuck another needle into my chest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如一根尖针刺入我的心头。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_92BD0387_003C_458B_BBFA_677D0840B7BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9428d7738fc703b61bb9f141467fbb94374a987927846facc4d52ae67058c32d
#. default-sha256: 2d16e64084fa4c05570e98b053f86cfc93e430c66110ffe523b01a08f1d695f9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_92BD0387_003C_458B_BBFA_677D0840B7BC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No one had told me my brother was to be married."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我完全不了解二哥的社交关系，⟪k:1⟫也没有人告诉我他即将结婚。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2EA1FB27_A290_45D4_B001_ED2BAE059597
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21d22cc95c73ec7310e6561d697ca8fb848562795052d995757afe10da7099a2
#. default-sha256: 1e120e693776ae5e98b8ca5c5e6fe87082ddbf91113549a351af2d4b0141f1b7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2EA1FB27_A290_45D4_B001_ED2BAE059597"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father Antonin looked so proud of his two boys—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Didier soon to receive his "
"assignment, and Georges soon to be wed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫大哥迪迪尔即将获得委任，⟪k:1⟫二哥乔治斯很快结婚，父亲很为他们骄傲。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_28390D52_0EA1_4574_8E8E_15A463F1A092
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91b16f1b5dec89c009ca2ebeff5e079fb274e2676ba7f2aca7c52d684ec2d9e6
#. default-sha256: 81158973dda52462398356ffa6af27190a786c936f390e1710bda15486f6dc53
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_28390D52_0EA1_4574_8E8E_15A463F1A092"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The banquet proceeded smoothly,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫晩餐气氛融洽——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_40ADECC1_364A_41F8_AF37_4F3E4BECF6B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58ba5d6736bfef6cfee19da4bc66e3a8be4a5aa6c24fff5bb5f9f581fc33eb47
#. default-sha256: 5a02f5429aee4cb58715b00fbcdf781a2006d8e5e952764bc481b07836bfd07c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_40ADECC1_364A_41F8_AF37_4F3E4BECF6B9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫not a doubt in the air that we were a happy family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫无论在谁看来都是幸福的一家。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_12A5BB5F_4099_4D82_9B68_037211FB700C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69853104f35481e88820e11883495794457ecc70ef31a3caf28316e54cc33505
#. default-sha256: 89939a90c1deb9c97304d4c72395175ec829424083c1fedfa69aab3639543e8f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_12A5BB5F_4099_4D82_9B68_037211FB700C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But my mind was elsewhere."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫只有我心不在焉。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_42746B8F_4494_49DF_A79B_BBA692F85693
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed6760e13d096921b90933f195ef4f4f1e3867187b37d7cada7e753c1f20de4f
#. default-sha256: 125e9f05a1c092bb38f8f6a752f5b0a9388f7b2616ff2cf0b364d3746b5f8fba
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_42746B8F_4494_49DF_A79B_BBA692F85693"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I found myself unconsciously chasing Aimee with my eyes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我的目光总是不自觉地追随着艾梅。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_82923E7B_2641_4CE0_85D9_3B478E646923
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c53bbf7cd2ace715db978a52d48b8c99078217ba69369899822b1d0615daa875
#. default-sha256: 4f8f0f929d9e21b4366c0436ca09c615309b02423e24306efc1994d99bbf80a1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_82923E7B_2641_4CE0_85D9_3B478E646923"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Watching the way those slender fingers gripped her spoon.⟪k:1⟫Her full lips parting to allow "
"a piece of fruit in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她握住银汤勺的纤细指尖，⟪k:1⟫含住果实的饱满嘴唇。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_991665B7_761E_4CBB_9097_F7C40F47BB38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d824fbc9ab37a2f64dd681fb73175be77ca12030993d54ab4fdf99b2f290c13b
#. default-sha256: 9c3e2b97d31c3a07298cbe49a7815faccb17533cffacadbf8738fbca1189f869
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_991665B7_761E_4CBB_9097_F7C40F47BB38"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her deep red tongue, visible for but the briefest of moments."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫张开嘴时，⟪k:1⟫有时能看到鲜红的舌头。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3AAE7B4F_BF85_459B_B8D0_40E238F55F91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a5f8ecd1ce7708c408efcb3c4c82633806659366b86673cbcdeb58e8aac7680
#. default-sha256: cc5308557641434e7dc15993921c79b4217ccbeef755aa12e463cb74f9ee39df
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3AAE7B4F_BF85_459B_B8D0_40E238F55F91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The way all the muscles in her face seemed to relax in bliss as sweet juices seeped into her "
"mouth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫吮吸甜美的果汁的时候，⟪k:1⟫她的眼角温和地垂下。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_936CDD6B_9C02_4118_9168_A93944FB0CB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bbbeb3d94eb14561892cc4c46aa6e7e7c8132b8e5401cd94264b3aa430d1dd2
#. default-sha256: afbcc1728de7fce461de44504fd80a3a49532cc7f54e8d368eaea1ce5725397a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_936CDD6B_9C02_4118_9168_A93944FB0CB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The way she spoke, so soft and gentle, letting each sound hang in the air just briefly "
"before intoning the next."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她说话时轻声细语，⟪k:1⟫如咏叹一般萦绕在空气中。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0D190A50_753D_446D_888B_297A70987ADE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74036b09eb2eaf908d2ef7f767779819fd5c5ceb141afdd22430c1e94e438729
#. default-sha256: e598749d29347194ef69bd60c65e876d06efa502a3e2c3710f4ebaf5343b587c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0D190A50_753D_446D_888B_297A70987ADE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was distinctly feminine—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in a different way than my mother."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她有着和母亲不一样的女性气质——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D0282D63_AB66_4BCD_B5CC_D26348888576
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7152fdf9df53b8840d26f4c5db379bebd09ece8fd652ee11803dde52f08b135b
#. default-sha256: 68d633a3dab8ecf861112403d8499f36c2b687d52e6b7937664c8df94e1b316f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D0282D63_AB66_4BCD_B5CC_D26348888576"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Apparently, Aimee was going to be living at the Bollinger estate for some time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……艾梅似乎要暂住在博林杰家。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_81C2E136_5BC7_4B56_8605_CACB3CA4CCA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5920198a77d4952b73e1608614e1784d97747e8dfeb538d8446611b7b52419f
#. default-sha256: 32760259deb2dd7102cfc6033e80ec7d25496a5decdd00b6baa0a19697286428
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_81C2E136_5BC7_4B56_8605_CACB3CA4CCA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had assumed I would hate being around another girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我以为我会很讨厌和另一个女孩在一起。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F1C4B5DF_CCD9_42D9_8198_E5C7C2159996
