msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我从路过的佣人手中，⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫强行夺过了一杯水——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FECFBDF3_A55A_4ADD_915D_B07164DC5E8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05246ba8ec10f95a076ad3dc83710f293bd34bf9267c75735460b073c160a294
