msgstr "⟪k:0⟫说话的口气很像男人啊。⟪k:1⟫但是，⟪k:2⟫这样也不错。⟪k:3⟫我很喜欢。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E87CAB54_D147_4DD3_B847_9EE7FF0445A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d17c619ac4343dc7db0773032aee5d0c1bc1d005299d44cd1e84fcd9ff078469
